sequenceDiagram
    %% SD6 - Exchange feedback and messages with parents
    %% Stories: 14, 17, 22, 41, 45
    %% Description: Parents submit feedback and concerns, receive bi-weekly feedback and notifications, message counselors and contact the staff in an emergency.
    actor PA as Parent
    actor AD as Camp administrator
    participant GD as Guardian
    participant FB as Feedback
    participant CA as Camper
    participant CS as Counselor
    participant CW as CampWorker

    %% covers 14
    PA->>GD: submit feedback and concerns
    GD->>FB: parent feedback
    %% covers 17
    AD->>CA: give bi-weekly feedback on the camper
    CA->>FB: camper feedback
    FB->>GD: notify of feedback
    %% covers 22
    AD->>GD: notify all parents at once
    %% covers 41
    PA->>CS: message counselors
    %% covers 45
    PA->>CW: contact staff in an emergency
